<Callout title="Check the rank before entering" tone="warning">
  <p>A dungeon’s <strong>rank reflects its difficulty and how aggressive its monsters are</strong>. Monster level alone does not tell you how safe an area is. Be careful in a low-level dungeon with a high rank: <strong>Thanatos Tower is Rank B</strong>, so its lower-level areas still need caution. Check both the level range and the rank before you enter.</p>
</Callout>
